                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.90f2/27: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Great
                        Britain (Mellon)</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1932-11-18T17:00:00-05:00">November 18,
                            1932—5 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>285. Draft note enclosed with your despatch 472, November 3 is approved.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
